sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Svc as Service instance
    participant Ag as Local agent
    participant GW as Ingest gateway
    participant Sh as Aggregation shard
    participant St as Metric store
    participant Q as Dashboard
    Svc->>Ag: counters and histograms
    Ag->>Ag: pre-aggregate over the flush interval
    Ag->>GW: compressed batch
    GW->>Sh: route by metric and label set
    Sh->>Sh: merge across instances into one series
    Note over Sh: histograms merge by bucket, so percentiles stay correct
    Sh->>St: write the rolled-up series
    Q->>St: query a time range
    St-->>Q: series, downsampled to the pixel width
